# unproven-claim-lexicon phrase (peer-review-uncited / multiplier-uncited /
# compounding-as-proven). The gate is a SHRINK RATCHET: this list may only get
# smaller. A baselined file that now has ZERO findings FAILS the gate demanding
# a prune; a NON-baselined live doc with a banned phrase FAILS as a regression.
